    {
     "t": "heading",
     "level": 4,
     "text": "Join us on Friday March 6, 2026 from 4pm – 6pm and learn more about Cali-Blaze products."
    },
    {
     "t": "rich",
     "html": "<p>From potent pre-rolls / infused pre-rolls and infused buds to delicious disposables, their offerings are designed to enhance your cannabis experience. Whether you’re a seasoned connoisseur or a curious newcomer, Cali-Blaze aims to be your go-to choice for all things cannabis, showcasing the best products that reflect our commitment to quality and innovation.</p><p><img src=\"assets/source/408d29b5-CaliblazeWebsiteAssets-1-1-1.png\" alt=\"Shop Cali Blaze Infused Buds at Cape Cod Cannabis in Wellfleet, MA\" width=\"685\" height=\"258\" title=\"Cape Cod Cannabis Recreational Dispensary in Wellfleet, MA\" data-source-url=\"https://b2702268.assetcdn.net/2.0/2702268/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/CaliblazeWebsiteAssets-1-1-1.png?lossy=2&amp;strip=0&amp;webp=1\"></p>"
    },
    {
     "t": "heading",
     "level": 2,
     "text": "Why Choose Cali-Blaze?"
    },
    {
     "t": "rich",
     "html": "<p>Each product is crafted with care, using the finest ingredients to deliver exceptional flavor and potency. Whether you’re looking for a quick smoke on the go or a more leisurely experience, our diverse range allows you to choose the perfect product to suit your lifestyle.</p>"
    },
    {
     "t": "rich",
     "html": "<p><a href=\"/brands/cali-blaze/\"><strong>Shop Cali-Blaze products now!</strong></a></p>"
    },
